abstract: >
  QVP-Global-System™ establishes a deterministic, reproducible,
  audit-oriented, and computationally traceable sovereign intelligence
  framework for cybersecurity benchmarking, AI governance evaluation,
  post-quantum resilience assessment, digital sovereignty analysis,
  systemic risk modeling, and computational governance research
  through the QSSI™ (Quantum Sovereign Security Index) architecture.

